[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 242.07, "timestamp": "00:04:02", "text": "实际上。一个是给Joex的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 244.71, "timestamp": "00:04:04", "text": "最近买了一个域名，我是说最近。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 247.75, "timestamp": "00:04:07", "text": "去年。另一个我买了三两个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 250.149, "timestamp": "00:04:10", "text": "多年来，我一直致力于一个名为“热情项目”的项目"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 251.67, "timestamp": "00:04:11", "text": "焦虑症。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 255.27, "timestamp": "00:04:15", "text": "呃，我好像已经把我的存档存档了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 257.59, "timestamp": "00:04:17", "text": "目前这个项目暂时搁置，因为我正在全力投入。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 260.789, "timestamp": "00:04:20", "text": "关注我的下一个运动员"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 263.59, "timestamp": "00:04:23", "text": "独立旅程，嗯，我专注于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 265.67, "timestamp": "00:04:25", "text": "运动员，不过在 x 网站上也是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 269.27, "timestamp": "00:04:29", "text": "然后是短链接域名"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 271.35, "timestamp": "00:04:31", "text": "我的所有链接和一切都正确"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 274.15, "timestamp": "00:04:34", "text": "我拥有的品牌链接是短链接"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 277.189, "timestamp": "00:04:37", "text": "域名也是，嗯，我把它打到聊天框里吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 281.99, "timestamp": "00:04:41", "text": "所以你就能看到它了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 285.59000000000003, "timestamp": "00:04:45", "text": "我觉得我需要一个命令来实现这个功能。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 287.427, "timestamp": "00:04:47", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "JoqniX - https://joqnix.space"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 288.79, "timestamp": "00:04:48", "text": "我其实需要一个命令来实现这个功能。黑暗的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 291.67, "timestamp": "00:04:51", "text": "接下来请说说你的想法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 294.71, "timestamp": "00:04:54", "text": "哦，你不能在 YouTube 上换行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "tim